      "description": "The meme is composed of two distinct visual panels stacked vertically. The top panel features a person in Native American regalia with text mocking the pronunciation of '1-800-abos-r-dum'. The bottom panel features a Black man in a tuxedo with text questioning his intelligence and belief in science. The two panels are juxtaposed to create a hateful message targeting the Black man based on race.",
