      "@type": "SemioticProjection",
      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User projected onto the Black man in the tuxedo",
      "description": "The meme uses rhetorical questions 'do you hate yourself?' and 'doubt science & established historical records?' directed at the Black man in the tuxedo, implicitly projecting the user's identity onto him as the target of the hateful message. The user is being asked to identify with or internalize the stereotype being applied to him, creating a direct projection of the user onto the visual material of the black_man_in_tuxedo.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
