      "description": "The text 'do you hate yourself?' and 'doubt science & established historical records?' is a direct address to the viewer, implying that the user is being asked to reflect on their own beliefs or character. This creates a projection where the user is being made to identify with the stereotype of being unintelligent or irrational, which is then applied to the black_man_in_tuxedo. The user is projected onto the textual material that contains these accusatory questions.",
